 This project declares no rules beyond its README.
+
+## Decisions taken
+
+- Cancellation refund (assumed by the developer, not confirmed by the school): full booking total if
+  cancelled strictly before the rental start, nothing from the start on. Change `cancel` in `src/index.ts`
+  if the school's policy differs.
